{"title":"Prettifying Graffiti","link":"https://kottke.org/26/01/prettifying-graffiti-1","date":1769707227000,"content":"\n        <p>For a project called Tag Clouds, street artist <a href=\"http://www.demodetouslesjours.eu/\">Mathieu Tremblin</a> paints over graffiti tags and makes them more legible.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1050\" height=\"900\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1050\" height=\"900\" /></p>\n\n<p>The result looks like when Word says that the Hardkaze and Aerosol fonts are used in the document you’re trying to open but are missing from your computer and you click OK to replace them with whatever’s available. I think the font above is Arial, which is perfect. I also like this faux-watermark piece he did:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-28455-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n\n         <p><em>[This is a vintage post originally from Jul 2016.]</em></p>\n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/graffiti\">graffiti</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Mathieu%20Tremblin\">Mathieu Tremblin</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/timeless%20posts\">timeless posts</a></p>\n\n        \n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"be2570799435412ebb76923f2061337bc43dd29df3925ab8f23161e0f2716533","category":"Sites"}